Package: totaljs-center
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: totaljs-node (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-docker-stack (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-dns (>= 1.0.0), adduser
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: Total.js Center, the front door of the Total.js Developer Distros
 A small Total.js 5 application on port 8010 that the reverse proxy shows at
 https://totaljs.developer: the address of the computer, the state of the
 services (Code, Flow, PostgreSQL and pgAdmin), the projects of /www with their
 addresses, and how to connect to the database. It runs as its own user without
 any special group and only reads the state of the services.
